  <h2 class="section-heading">4.2. Homology stability.</h2>
  <p>Let <span data-field="object_name_23">{{ object_name_23 }}</span> be an oriented surface of genus <span data-field="genus_g">{{ genus_g }}</span> with <span data-field="boundary_components">{{ boundary_components }}</span> boundary components and <span data-field="punctures">{{ punctures }}</span> punctures, and let <span data-field="object_name_24">{{ object_name_24 }}</span> its group of orientation preserving diffeomorphisms that restrict to the identity near the boundary. The mapping class group is its group of connected components</p>
