  <h2 class="section-heading">4.3. Pair of pants product.</h2>
  <p>Two surfaces <span data-field="surface_1">{{ surface_1 }}</span> and <span data-field="surface_2">{{ surface_2 }}</span> can be glued to a pair of pants surface to form a surface <span data-field="surface_3">{{ surface_3 }}</span> as illustrated in Figure 2. Again by extending diffeomorphisms via the identity, this construction can be used to define a map of mapping class groups</p>
