        </p>
        <p>
            <span class="section-header">8.4. A group closely related to the mapping class group is the automorphism group of a free group, Aut_F_n.</span> By considering a moduli space of graphs embedded in <span data-field="space_name">{{ space_name }}</span> Galatius [G2] was able to show the analogue of Mumford's conjecture for these groups:
        </p>
